Changes made by Railyard (all additive):
- src/railyard/**: batch ingest from the Railyard edge collector (no IP address
  is ever received or stored), per-organization tenant summaries, and the
  API-only switch;
- src/app/api/v1/**: the ingest and tenant summary routes;
- src/proxy.ts: with INSIGHTS_API_ONLY=1 only /v1/*, /api/v1/* and the
  heartbeat are served, so the upstream dashboard is never public;
- prisma/migrations/90_railyard_ingest_receipts: de-duplication of retried
  collector batches.
